jobs.description:
01

Key requirements

We are looking for a Project Manager to help coordinate a company-wide financial process automation project. The estimated project duration is 1–1.5 years. We are open to considering candidates for both full-time and part-time roles. The work format can be either remote or on-site.

Requirements

Higher education in finance or a related field;
Experience participating in ERP system implementations;
Experience working on financial or business process automation projects;
Understanding of key financial processes within a company;
Experience collaborating with IT teams and external contractors;
Ability to coordinate multiple project stakeholders and organize workflows effectively.

02

Duties include

Coordinate the financial process automation project;
Gather and align system requirements with the finance and IT teams;
Organize collaboration with external consultants and internal teams;
Monitor the progress of key project milestones;
Participate in testing and implementation of new solutions;
Support the team during the transition to new processes.

Please send your CV to cv@sk.ua.

